Dialogue: 7,0:22:17.78,0:22:17.94,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,阿庫亞認為  兇手就在Lalala{\alpha&HFF&}i裡
Dialogue: 7,0:22:17.94,0:22:18.11,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,阿庫亞認為  兇手就在Lalalai{\alpha&HFF&}裡
Dialogue: 7,0:22:18.11,0:22:18.82,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,阿庫亞認為  兇手就在Lalalai裡
Comment: 7,0:22:19.55,0:22:21.35,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,但這是  愛在懷孕前
Dialogue: 7,0:22:19.57,0:22:19.74,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,但{\alpha&HFF&}這是  愛在懷孕前
Dialogue: 7,0:22:19.74,0:22:19.90,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,但這{\alpha&HFF&}是  愛在懷孕前
Dialogue: 7,0:22:19.90,0:22:20.07,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,但這是{\alpha&HFF&}  愛在懷孕前
Dialogue: 7,0:22:20.07,0:22:20.28,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,但這是 {\alpha&HFF&} 愛在懷孕前
Dialogue: 7,0:22:20.28,0:22:20.45,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,但這是  {\alpha&HFF&}愛在懷孕前
Dialogue: 7,0:22:20.45,0:22:20.61,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,但這是  愛{\alpha&HFF&}在懷孕前
